 in crisis\", \"makes correct decisions quickly\", \"understands complicated technology\", \"excellent attention skills\", \"difficulty communicating ideas\", \"regarded as egocentric\", \"not very willing to further his education\". Also mention that D's weak leadership and moody nature are concerns.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I see the arguments for C, and after reconsidering D's concerns, I now recommend C.\" Provide vote in metadata.\n\nProceed."}
